---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 9,
  title: 'Day 9',
  date: '2026-09-14',
  description: 'Ninth day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Unfortunatly, I didn't write my blog for a few days, When I writing
          It, It's already 16.09, so I'll write from my memory, It was probably
          a day in which I finally installed linux at my old Ipad, I think it's
          quite funny expirience, becouse, it somehow working but when I tried
          to install Visual Studio Code, It's just editor for coding, only
          reason why I needed Linux was to install this program, I even find a
          way to install it from terminal,In process I even connected keyboard,
          becouse Virtual keaboard cover almost whole screen but I needed to
          confirm that what I wrote is writen, and I somehow did It I even
          installed about 60% of vsc, but then my linux crashed and after that,
          Linux stoped working(I gave linux 30GB so It couldn't be becouse of
          memeory), probably my Ipad was tooo bad to run it correctly. But at
          least I learn how to do it, I hope It'll work at my new Ipad, I didn't
          expect from this ipad that much, So I'm happy that I did it
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        It's a bit weird to write plan for yesterday, sooo, I have no plan for
        tomorrow
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 3/10, I installed Linux as I planed, but I didn't learn
          Next.js, and I didn't even write blog
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <DayRating class="w-full" rating={3} />
  </article>
</Layout>
